{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46973","headline":"答献上人卷 · 齐己","name":"答献上人卷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衲衣禅客袖篇章，江上相寻共感伤。\n秦甸乱来栖白没，杼山空後皎然亡。\n清留岛月秋凝露，苦寄巴猨夜叫霜。\n珍重南宗好才子，灰心冥目外无妨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46973.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46973","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}